    "text": "The fact that so many Canadians actually believed that Carney would be able to stroll into the White House and spar with Trump on the same level just goes to show how delusional Canadians have become about their significance in the world.\nHere's a dose of reality for canuk friends:\n- The United States is indisputably the World's #1 super power.\n- Canada isn't number 2 or 3 or 4...\n- Canada isn't even on the list remotely approaching a super power.\n- If Canada wasn't sharing a border with the U.S., most people in the world would not be able to find it on a map.\nSorry, but that's the truth of it.",
